WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.269 --> 00:00:03.537
TIME FOR THE FASTEST-7.

00:00:03.538 --> 00:00:05.672
FIRST UP, HARD TO BELIEVE

00:00:05.673 --> 00:00:07.641
SITUATION THAT A HIGH SCHOOL IN

00:00:07.642 --> 00:00:08.508
NEW HAMPSHIRE.

00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:09.810
A LUNCH LADY SAID SHE WAS FIRED

00:00:09.811 --> 00:00:13.346
FOR GIVING A STUDENT A FREE

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:15.749
LUNCH WORTH ONLY $8.

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.617
SHE WAS ACCUSED OF THEFT BY THE

00:00:17.618 --> 00:00:19.753
FOOD VENDOR AND ASKED THE TEEN

00:00:19.754 --> 00:00:24.858
TO PAY HIS DEPT THE NEXT DAY.

00:00:24.859 --> 00:00:30.697
TWO WORKERS QUIT BUT THE FOOD

00:00:30.698 --> 00:00:32.132
WORKER SAID THIS IS UNTRUE.

00:00:32.133 --> 00:00:33.667
I LOVE LUNCH LADIES.

00:00:33.668 --> 00:00:36.603
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW WHAT?

00:00:36.604 --> 00:00:42.843
I AM GOING TO TAKE AN UNPOPULAR

00:00:42.844 --> 00:00:43.176
STANCE.

00:00:43.177 --> 00:00:43.844
I DON'T BELIEVE THE STORY.

00:00:43.845 --> 00:00:47.180
SHE SHOULD HAVE GOTTEN IN

00:00:47.181 --> 00:00:47.514
TROUBLE.

00:00:47.515 --> 00:00:50.984
ONLY $8 IS A LOT OF MONEY.

00:00:50.985 --> 00:00:53.286
TALK TO ANY BAR OWNER.

00:00:53.287 --> 00:00:55.956
THE THING THAT KILLS A BUSINESS

00:00:55.957 --> 00:00:58.124
IS PEOPLE GIVING AWAY FREE

00:00:58.125 --> 00:00:58.425
BOOZE.

00:00:58.426 --> 00:01:00.160
I AM JUST TRYING TO MAKE AN

00:01:00.161 --> 00:01:00.527
ARGUMENT.

00:01:00.528 --> 00:01:01.294
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHING].

00:01:01.295 --> 00:01:04.831
&gt;&gt; IT'S EASY FOR A BARTENDER TO

00:01:04.832 --> 00:01:07.567
BE GENEROUS IF HE DOESN'T PAY

00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:08.235
FOR THE BOOZE.

00:01:08.236 --> 00:01:10.504
SHE WAS GIVING AWAY THE SCHOOL'S

00:01:10.505 --> 00:01:10.837
FOOD.

00:01:10.838 --> 00:01:12.239
SHOULD BE ARRESTED.

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:12.973
&gt;&gt; LOCK HER UP.

00:01:12.974 --> 00:01:14.808
&gt;&gt; AND THE CHILD NEEDS TO GO

00:01:14.809 --> 00:01:16.710
AWAY TO SUMMER CAMP.

00:01:16.711 --> 00:01:17.544
A FUN CAMP.

00:01:17.545 --> 00:01:18.912
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHING].

00:01:18.913 --> 00:01:21.581
&gt;&gt; I FEEL FOR HER AND FOR THE

00:01:21.582 --> 00:01:21.882
BOY.

00:01:21.883 --> 00:01:23.583
IT'S NOT EASY.

00:01:23.584 --> 00:01:25.452
YOU ARE BROKE.

00:01:25.453 --> 00:01:27.888
WHAT IS INTERESTING, SHE TOOK

00:01:27.889 --> 00:01:28.421
THAT RISK.

00:01:28.422 --> 00:01:30.123
SHE ALLOWED HIM TO DO THAT.

00:01:30.124 --> 00:01:33.960
IF YOU DO THAT, YOU OFTEN DO GET

00:01:33.961 --> 00:01:34.528
PAID BACK.

00:01:34.529 --> 00:01:37.464
THEY PAID IT BACK THE NEXT.

00:01:37.465 --> 00:01:38.298
&gt;&gt; JUAN?

00:01:38.299 --> 00:01:40.367
&gt;&gt; WAS IT A MICHELLE OBAMA

00:01:40.368 --> 00:01:40.667
LUNCH?

00:01:40.668 --> 00:01:42.402
THOSE ARE NOT WORTH $8.

00:01:42.403 --> 00:01:44.771
&gt;&gt; I LOVE HOW YOU BROUGHT THE

00:01:44.772 --> 00:01:45.572
OBAMAS INTO THIS.

00:01:45.573 --> 00:01:46.506
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHING].

00:01:46.507 --> 00:01:50.677
&gt;&gt; IS THAT MYSTERY MEAT?

00:01:50.678 --> 00:01:51.211
EVERYONE HATE IT.

00:01:51.212 --> 00:01:53.446
&gt;&gt; I DON'T KNOW.

00:01:53.447 --> 00:01:54.848
I FORGET.

00:01:54.849 --> 00:01:57.317
&gt;&gt; [LAUGHING].

00:01:57.318 --> 00:01:59.019
&gt;&gt; IT'S A GOOD THING I DIDN'T GO

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:02.422
TO THE CAFETERIA.

00:02:02.423 --> 00:02:05.559
I NOTICED TWO OF HER COLLEAGUES

00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:06.993
QUIT IN SUPPORT OF HER.

00:02:06.994 --> 00:02:09.095
BUT PART OF THE STORY IS THE

00:02:09.096 --> 00:02:11.932
FOOD SERVICE HAD A COMPETITOR

00:02:11.933 --> 00:02:13.967
COME IN AND WAS LOOKING AT THE

00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:15.835
SCHOOL AND WAS WORRIED THAT THE

00:02:15.836 --> 00:02:16.770
SCHOOL DISTRICT WOULD GIVE THE

00:02:16.771 --> 00:02:18.805
BUSINESS TO THE COMPETITOR.

00:02:18.806 --> 00:02:20.040
&gt;&gt; I KNEW THERE WAS ANOTHER

00:02:20.041 --> 00:02:20.340
EDGE.

00:02:20.341 --> 00:02:22.877
&gt;&gt; THIS IS WHAT WE ARE THESE

